@startuml
title State Diagram - ATM

[*] --> Greeting : Card inserted

state Greeting
state PinCheck
state "IncorrectPinAttempts" as IncorrectPinAttempts
state Options
state Processing
state KeptCard <<final>>
state ReturnedCard <<final>>

PinCheck : do / validatePIN

Greeting --> PinCheck : PIN entered

PinCheck --> IncorrectPinAttempts : PIN incorrect\nattempts < maxAttempts

PinCheck --> Options : PIN correct

IncorrectPinAttempts --> PinCheck : Try again

IncorrectPinAttempts --> KeptCard : attempts >= maxAttempts

Options --> Processing : Request selected

Processing --> ReturnedCard : User cancels

ReturnedCard --> [*]
KeptCard --> [*]

@enduml
